# Heavy binary media — kept locally, never committed. Stock clips live in
# remotion/public/stock/<id>/clip.mp4 (sidecar meta.json + transcript.json
# stay tracked). Audio cue samples in remotion/public/audio/<gesture>/NN.mp3
# are placeholders pending the real curation pass — we're not committing
# static audio while the pipeline is still in flux.
remotion/public/stock/*/clip.mp4
remotion/public/audio/**/*.mp3
hooks/*.mp4
tests/fixtures/clips/*.mp4
tests/quality/references/*/source.mp4

